<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Dec 27.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Dec 27.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   116/118   123/125     UNQ     240/241</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  123/124   129/131   231/245   255/262</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS - Bunker prices end $3.00 per tonne softer amid healthy supplies as sellers rushed to meet 1996 sales targets. Most shipowners decided to postpone covering requirements until Monday, expecting lower prices. Gas oil and diesel steady.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-0870-3082)</p>
